# SQLite files, from running the application locally.
#
# The tests never write here — each opens a database in a temp directory and
# removes it afterwards — so anything matching this came from a manual run.
# The -wal and -shm companions are listed because WAL is on: deleting only the
# .db leaves them behind, and a stale -wal can be read back into a database you
# thought you had removed.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
